  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: Fix ResponsesConversions omitting the required 'summary' field on\nreasoning input items when round-tripping a ReasoningBlock that carries only\nan encrypted-content Signature (the common shape when Include includes\n\"reasoning.encrypted_content\" without also requesting a ReasoningSummary).\nOpenAI's Responses API rejects such requests with \"Missing required\nparameter: 'input[N].summary'.\" — this surfaces as a hard turn failure any\ntime a reasoning-enabled model call is followed by another call within the\nsame turn (e.g. after a tool call). Also bumps the Universal.OpenAI.Client\nfloor to 4.2.1 for the gpt-5.6 model family (incl. Sol/Terra/Luna).",
